=== DESIGN ===
package=internal/tesla/codec
public_surface=Decode(payload []byte) ([]Atomic, error) + Atomic struct{Field,Value,EmittedAt,VehicleID}
boundary_contract=ADR-004 #4 — codec FLATTENS all compounds before emitting; downstream sees only typed primitives + ftproto enum types
flatteners (per compound message variant):
  - Location ({fieldName}Latitude/{fieldName}Longitude, 2 atoms)
  - Doors    ({fieldName}{DriverFront,DriverRear,PassengerFront,PassengerRear,TrunkFront,TrunkRear}, 6 atoms)
  - TireLocation ({fieldName}{FrontLeft,FrontRight,RearLeft,RearRight,SemiMiddleAxleLeft2,SemiMiddleAxleRight2,SemiRearAxleLeft,SemiRearAxleRight,SemiRearAxleLeft2,SemiRearAxleRight2}, 10 atoms)
  - Time     ({fieldName}, single time.Time anchored to EmittedAt UTC date)
flatteners (per JSON-shaped string compound):
  - DoorState (Field=58)               -> 6 boolean atoms with FrontTrunk/RearTrunk JSON keys
  - ScheduledChargingStartTime (Field=44) -> single time.Time
  - ScheduledDepartureTime    (Field=46) -> single time.Time
error semantics:
  - outer proto.Unmarshal err   => Decode returns err (MQTT redelivery candidate)
  - ErrInvalid                  => drop + bump teslasync_codec_invalid_values_total{field}
  - ErrUnsetValue               => drop + bump teslasync_codec_unset_values_total{field}
  - other DecodeDatum err       => drop + bump teslasync_codec_decode_errors_total{field}
  - per-Datum flatten err       => drop + bump teslasync_codec_flatten_errors_total{field}
adr_004_invariants_enforced=
  #2 'codec is the bytes->Atomic seam': Decode is the only exported function
  #4 'no nested maps cross ingest': forbidden-type reflective test in codec_test.go
  redelivery rule: only outer Unmarshal err returns non-nil err; per-Datum failures drop+count

